  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Trong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình bình hành.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình bình hành.<br>Mà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>E</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>E</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình bình hành, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>G</mi></semantics></math> là trọng tâm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>F</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/29eb7f03416601825b4be4a4d2d9ed5cd6d84f0550e80a81049af2c11eb0f24a.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
